OL,3,GNEWSACatherine meets recovering addicts
OL,4,Aon garden visit
OL,5,
OL,6,FCatherine, Princess of Wales heard
OL,7,Fmoving stories from people recovering
OL,8,Ffrom addiction as she visited a garden
OL,9,Fwhere people in recovery can embrace
OL,10,Fthe outdoors.
OL,12,FAs patron of the Forward Trust - a
OL,13,Fcharity that supports recovering
OL,14,Faddicts - she spent time at its new
OL,15,Fgreen space in Garon Park,
OL,16,FSouthend-on-Sea.
OL,18,FThe princess met service users
OL,19,Fincluding recovering alcoholic Steph
OL,20,FSampson, who told how in the depths of
OL,21,Fher addiction she lied to her children
OL,22,Fabout her alcohol consumption.
OL,23,APub: 24-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,376,370,200,160,0,100
